<view class="page-shell ritual-page">
  <image class="page-background" src="/assets/images/page-bg.png" mode="aspectFill"></image>
  <view class="page-background-shade"></view>

  <view class="ritual-action {{isDivining ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="handleDivine">
    <view class="spinning-ring" wx:if="{{isDivining}}"></view>
    <view class="circle">
      <view class="inner">{{isDivining ? '起课中' : '起念'}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="title">心中默念所想</view>
  <view class="guidance">
    <view>请在心中默问一件小事，一个方向。</view>
    <view class="guidance-line">宜问：这件事今天推进，是否合适？</view>
    <view class="guidance-line">不宜问：我应该怎么办？</view>
    <view class="guidance-note">不以玩笑试探，不反复追问同一事。</view>
  </view>
</view>
